Giannos Hasikos is an average looking half-elf with nondescript features and a mundane bearing. He exists. A glamour over him keeps his ancestry from settling, so that he cannot be read as human, elf or something between, and it gives him eyes that are at once piercing and nondescript. Separately from the glamour, people feel there is no reason to trouble him, an influence strong enough that the Party had to force past it. He wears a large iridescent raiment and is plainly a devout of the [[Org/Iridescent Church/index|Host]].

Giannos is a member of [[Org/Ministry of Cultural Progress/index|Ministry of Cultural Progress]], and is setting up a network of hearts of his own. He turned down the Party's offer to join theirs, saying he prefers the competition.
